{"material_id": "ntce.youer.zonghe.2012a.q29.material.recovered", "text": "李友星是北京某中学的优秀教师，他积极响应国家号召，远赴千里之外的大西北—宁夏的农村学校支教，面对那漫无边际的黄沙和贫穷落后的恶劣环境，他没有改变初衷，没有退却，更没有放弃，毅然选择了为当地教育事业奋斗终生的远大理想，面对那一双双求知若渴的眼眸，他没有放弃每一名学生，用自己的教学艺术吸引学生，用自己的实际行动感化家长，用自己的人格感染周围的所有人，取得了丰硕成果：支教40余年来，经他教过的学生达一万多人，有的出国留学，有的出任名牌大学教授，有的回到家乡继续着他的事业。这就更验证了那句话：桃李满天下，而这也正是他一生所追求的人生目标。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "d7341d1f1a44288a520ae912b3181d7f9f4670185b5fcb5f22eaf40f7e27040c", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3692, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3960, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 29, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "d7341d1f1a44288a520ae912b3181d7f9f4670185b5fcb5f22eaf40f7e27040c"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2012a.q29"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.m3.k02", "ntce.youer.zonghe.m4.k04"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.ethics", "ntce.youer.ability.literacy"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.101.r023"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2012a.q29"], "word_count": 268, "level": "youer", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "d7341d1f1a44288a520ae912b3181d7f9f4670185b5fcb5f22eaf40f7e27040c", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3692, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3960, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 29, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "d7341d1f1a44288a520ae912b3181d7f9f4670185b5fcb5f22eaf40f7e27040c"}], "type": "真题", "copyright": {"authorization_status": "unknown", "holder": null, "use_scope": "research_non_commercial", "expires_at": null, "source_nature": "official_exam", "nature_note": "教育主管部门公开发布的考试试题", "nature_evidence": "filename_pattern:官方真题命名", "attribution_required": false}}}
{"material_id": "ntce.youer.zonghe.2012a.q30.material.recovered", "text": "小华这段时间有一个不好的行为，就是总爱把班级里好玩的玩具偷偷地藏起来，有时放在自己的衣帽柜，有时放在自己的衣服兜里，有时还会放在户外的某个角落。老师请来了小华的妈妈，委婉地向她说明了请她来的原因，小华的妈妈非常感激老师及时发现了孩子这个不好的行为，并与老师沟通，决心一起教育好孩子，又一再请求老师一定要替她的儿子保密，以保护儿子心灵不受伤害。经过一段时间的共同努力，小华的不良行为得到了改正。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "d7341d1f1a44288a520ae912b3181d7f9f4670185b5fcb5f22eaf40f7e27040c", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4003, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4199, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 30, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "d7341d1f1a44288a520ae912b3181d7f9f4670185b5fcb5f22eaf40f7e27040c"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2012a.q30"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.m3.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.ethics"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.101.r023"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2012a.q30"], "word_count": 196, "level": "youer", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "d7341d1f1a44288a520ae912b3181d7f9f4670185b5fcb5f22eaf40f7e27040c", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4003, "decoded_csv_character_end": 4199, "next_source_question_number": 32, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 30, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "d7341d1f1a44288a520ae912b3181d7f9f4670185b5fcb5f22eaf40f7e27040c"}], "type": "真题", "copyri