{"material_id": "ntce.youer.zonghe.2012a.q31.material.recovered", "text": "5岁男童阳阳比较好动，常常不按照老师的要求活动，因此班主任李老师一直都不喜欢他。2006年11月1213，班里的小朋友都在一起玩玩具，阳阳与汪汪因为一部小汽车而争抢起来，阳阳将汪汪推倒在地，并将小汽车扔出了窗外。事后，李老师将阳阳的小手绑住，将他放在教室里高高的柜子上，随即关上门离开教室。阳阳为了挣脱绳索，在扭动身体时不慎从柜子上掉下来，头部被摔成脑震荡，额头缝了三针。事后，阳阳的家长要求李老师承担全部责任。但李老师认为，根据《教师法》和《教育法》的规定，她享有管理学生的权利，对阳阳所造成的伤害仅仅是场意外事故，她只承担部分责任。", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "d7341d1f1a44288a520ae912b3181d7f9f4670185b5fcb5f22eaf40f7e27040c", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4740, "decoded_csv_character_end": 5008, "next_source_question_number": 34, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 31, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "d7341d1f1a44288a520ae912b3181d7f9f4670185b5fcb5f22eaf40f7e27040c"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2012a.q31"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.m2.k01", "ntce.youer.zonghe.m2.k02", "ntce.youer.zonghe.m3.k02"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.youer.ability.ethics"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.101.r011", "ntce.outline.101.r013", "ntce.outline.101.r014", "ntce.outline.101.r015", "ntce.outline.101.r023"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.youer.zonghe.2012a.q31"], "word_count": 268, "level": "youer", "subject": "zonghe", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/幼儿真题/2012年上半年教师资格考试《综合素质》（幼儿园）真题.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "d7341d1f1a44288a520ae912b3181d7f9f4670185b5fcb5f22eaf40f7e27040c", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 4740, "decoded_csv_character_end": 5008, "next_source_question_number": 34, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题